OL,3,GNEWSAMan in court after police officer
OL,4,Ashot in the foot
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court in
OL,7,Fconnection with the shooting of a
OL,8,Fpolice officer in Nottingham city
OL,9,Fcentre.
OL,11,FPC Lee Lane was shot in the foot after
OL,12,Fapproaching two people at a bus stop in
OL,13,FAngel Row at about 04:50 BST on 18
OL,14,FOctober. Nottingham Magistrates' Court
OL,15,Fpreviously heard the officer has since
OL,16,Fhad "several surgeries".
OL,18,FJahmal Ruddock-Senior appeared before
OL,19,Fmagistrates on Monday charged with
OL,20,Fassisting an offender.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
