OL,4,Ashot in the foot
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 35-year-old, of Gaul Street in
OL,7,FBulwell, is next set to appear at
OL,8,FNottingham Crown Court on 20 November
OL,9,Fand was remanded into custody.
